1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,382
You want a McFlurry.

2
00:00:01,382 --> 00:00:03,762
“Sorry, the machine is broken.”

3
00:00:03,762 --> 00:00:05,370
AGAIN.

4
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:06,786
Usually, it's not broken.

5
00:00:06,786 --> 00:00:08,208
It's cleaning itself.

6
00:00:08,208 --> 00:00:10,542
Every night it heats up to kill bacteria,

7
00:00:10,542 --> 00:00:12,213
then cools down.

8
00:00:12,213 --> 00:00:13,640
About FOUR hours.

9
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:15,597
If one step runs too long...

10
00:00:15,597 --> 00:00:17,338
the cycle fails.

11
00:00:17,338 --> 00:00:19,570
Error codes like this.

12
00:00:19,570 --> 00:00:21,161
Staff often can't fix it.

13
00:00:21,161 --> 00:00:22,136
They wait for a technician.

14
00:00:22,136 --> 00:00:23,431
That can take days.

15
00:00:23,431 --> 00:00:25,602
Then in 2024, the U.S. made it

16
00:00:25,602 --> 00:00:27,921
legal to unlock these machines for repair.

17
00:00:27,921 --> 00:00:29,245
The problem wasn't the ice cream.

18
00:00:29,245 --> 00:00:30,823
It was who's ALLOWED

19
00:00:30,823 --> 00:00:31,890
to fix the machine.
